    "detailed_description": "Create images/textures based on fractals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Fractal Brush you can create images or textures that will surprise you not only when you have created them, but also when creating them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFractal Brush has more than 100 patterns based on fractals that are the basis of its operation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach pattern is unique, so its behavior when generating fractals is also unique, and it takes a little practice to draw what you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt also has the possibility of creating your own patterns and saving them to use them whenever you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTips:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1 - Press the &quot;Esc&quot; key to access the main menu.<br />\r\n2 - Press the &quot;Q&quot; key to quickly access the brush menu.<br />\r\n3 - Press the &quot;E&quot; key to quickly access the brush settings.<br />\r\n4 - Press the &quot;Control&quot; + &quot;Z&quot; keys to undo.<br />\r\n5 - Press the &quot;Control&quot; + &quot;Shift&quot; + &quot;Z&quot; keys to redo.<br />\r\n6 - You can read these and more tips by pressing the &quot;TUTORIAL&quot; button.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWARNING: PHOTOSENSITIVE EPILEPSY SEIZURE RISK",
    "about_the_game": "Create images/textures based on fractals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Fractal Brush you can create images or textures that will surprise you not only when you have created them, but also when creating them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFractal Brush has more than 100 patterns based on fractals that are the basis of its operation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach pattern is unique, so its behavior when generating fractals is also unique, and it takes a little practice to draw what you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt also has the possibility of creating your own patterns and saving them to use them whenever you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTips:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1 - Press the &quot;Esc&quot; key to access the main menu.<br />\r\n2 - Press the &quot;Q&quot; key to quickly access the brush menu.<br />\r\n3 - Press the &quot;E&quot; key to quickly access the brush settings.<br />\r\n4 - Press the &quot;Control&quot; + &quot;Z&quot; keys to undo.<br />\r\n5 - Press the &quot;Control&quot; + &quot;Shift&quot; + &quot;Z&quot; keys to redo.<br />\r\n6 - You can read these and more tips by pressing the &quot;TUTORIAL&quot; button.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWARNING: PHOTOSENSITIVE EPILEPSY SEIZURE RISK",
